    <briefdescription>
<para>Token-bucket burst-rate limiter for the scraper crawl pipeline. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>1.0.0</para>
</simplesect>
Header-only. No additional translation unit is required.</para>
<sect1 id="scraper__burst__controller_8h_1autotoc_md5_1s1"><sect2 id="scraper__burst__controller_8h_1autotoc_md5">
<title>Design</title><para><computeroutput>BurstCrawlController</computeroutput> implements a fail-fast token-bucket algorithm:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>The bucket holds at most <computeroutput>max_tokens</computeroutput> tokens.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Tokens are added at <computeroutput>refill_rate_per_sec</computeroutput> per second (capped at capacity).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>tryAcquire()</computeroutput> first tops-up the bucket for elapsed time, then attempts an atomic decrement. The call never blocks; it returns false immediately when the bucket is empty.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="scraper__plugin_8h" kindref="compound">include/scraper/scraper_plugin.h</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
</sect2></sect1>
